[[2047,127,8,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The connector \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>D75</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives a supply\ndirectly (pin 6) from the battery via the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and the maxifuse J/B1 of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>It receives a supply controlled by the ignition\n(INT) (pin 8) via the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply with the side lights switched\non reaches pin 7 via the line coming from the switch for the steering\ncolumn switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and protected by the fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B.</strong></p><p>Pin 5 of connection  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>D75</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is earthed,\nwhile pins 9 and 10 provide the signal for the speaker \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nconnector B, while connector A is for the radio \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234201\">E3510</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Lastly, pin 1 is connected to the radio \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (MUTE\nfunction).</p>"]]